    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 379,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "21st Filmfare Awards\nThe 21st Filmfare Awards were held in 1974 . Shakti Samanta 's Anuraag won the Best Film award , but fail to win any other awards , a feat which was repeated by a few films in the 1970s . Raj Kapoor 's Bobby , Yash Chopra 's Daag : A Poem of Love , Hrishikesh Mukherjee 's Namak Haraam and Abhimaan and Prakash Mehra 's Zanjeer shared the awards among them ."
     }
    ],
    "status": "ok"
   },
