      "text": "Sidekicks (1974 film)\nSidekicks is a 1974 TV-movie directed by Burt Kennedy and starring Larry Hagman and Louis Gossett , Jr. . The film was a pilot for a proposed television show as a continuation of the 1971 theatrical release Skin Game , with James Garner and Gossett ."
