    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 457,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Daag (1952 film)\nDaag ( translation : The Stain ) is a 1952 Indian Hindi film produced and directed by Amiya Chakravarty . The film stars Dilip Kumar , Nimmi and Lalita Pawar in lead roles . The film 's music is composed by duo Shankar Jaikishan . Dilip Kumar won the first ever Filmfare Award in the Best Actor category for his performance in this film . The Awards were instituted from 1954 . The film fared well at the box office and was declared a hit ."
     }
