    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 526,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Tag and release\nTag and release is a form of catch and release fishing in which the angler attaches a tag to the fish , records data such as date , time , place , and type of fish on a standardized postcard , and submits this card to a fisheries agency or conservation organization . Anglers who catch tagged fish report their location , date , and time , as well as the tag number to established points of contact . South Carolina has had such a program since 1974 . A tag and release program is in place in NSW , Australia ."
     }
